@alife-records 1

node vp_1227.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Can use a sink if water's available.. ask before I waste your soap
  t.any.2 A towel each if there's enough.. hospital habits don't stop because we're visiting
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 Sit?.. yes, before I tell you to.. got that in the wrong order again
  t.any.2 Somewhere I won't block the doorway.. difficult habit to lose
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_HOUSE_CHORES
  t.any.1 Can wash our cups.. don't need to prove I deserve a chair by doing the whole kitchen
  t.any.2 Ask before I label anything.. your jars don't belong to Irene
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_HOUSE_PRAYER
  t.lo.1 Yes, a minute.. would like to find a church too, roof and people who know one another
  t.mid.1 I'd take time to pray.. church helped when we flooded, keep expecting the same answer now
  t.hi.1 Yes, could pray here.. won't say your house needs blessing to earn its roof
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_HOUSE_SHELF
  t.any.1 Mystery paperback would suit.. no hospital stories tonight please
  t.any.2 Canning books can wait.. don't need work dressed as a quiet evening
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Tell me the rules before I start behaving like I work here
  t.any.2 Blanket by the bag?.. won't turn your hallway into a ward
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  t.any.1 Pen and cigarettes.. gray flood blanket takes most of the room
  t.any.2 One clean jar label.. what a useful thing to save when we left everything
  fx.1 next VQ_PAST_KEEPSAKE
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Can listen to what happened.. won't name an illness from your doorway
  t.any.2 Practical help after a meal.. find myself volunteering before I can stand straight
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.lo.1 Yes.. that was an actual yes, not a request to feed Connie instead
  t.mid.1 Last proper food before I left the hospital.. counting cigarettes isn't counting meals
  t.hi.1 A plate I can sit over.. stop me if I try eating while checking the door
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Feet object to the route like everyone else.. I'd let someone check them
  t.any.2 Scrubs aren't evidence I'm fit to keep walking.. I'd like a chair before deciding
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_PARTNER
  gate.rule partner
  t.any.1 Connie's here.. let her answer whether she wants help
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_PARTNER.a2
  gate.rule partnerGone
  t.any.1 She's eighteen.. keep repeating that so I stop making every decision for her
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_PARTNER.a2.d
  t.any.1 My daughter's listening.. speak to her too
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_PARTNER.a2.d2
  t.any.1 Won't give a private account over Connie's own voice
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Find a church roof first.. north afterward if we learn a usable route
  t.any.2 Connie wants a doctor.. being her mother makes my opinion less useful, not more
  t.any.3 Need to choose as a person, not keep finding somebody to look after
  t.any.4 No settled route. Connie gets a say in hers, whatever I think
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_NOW_SMOKE
  t.any.1 Yes.. outside if you'll tell me where, never beside your food
  t.any.2 Cigarettes in the pocket.. dislike how often that's the pocket I check
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 If it's spare.. ours is old and doesn't stretch into two
  t.any.2 Connie may want her own.. offer it to her, don't make me the counter
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Yes.. Connie gets her own answer, this one's mine
  t.any.2 Something without a cigarette following it for once.. I'll sit down to eat
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_OFFER_SMOKES
  t.any.1 Yes.. keep enough for yourself if you use them
  t.any.2 I'll accept a few.. not calling it medicine to make the request prettier
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 Flood in sixty-three.. six years old, all I wanted saved was the kitchen stool
  t.any.2 Church people brought blankets.. remembered that longer than the name of the street we left
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_DAUGHTER
  t.any.1 Connie's eighteen.. ask about baseball and let her correct you
  t.any.2 She left in June.. we found each other afterward, that much is settled
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.lo.1 Hospital.. didn't get to pretend the radio was exaggerating for long
  t.mid.1 Kept a pen ready after there was nobody taking the notes from me
  t.hi.1 Left thinking of Connie's road.. every doorway kept turning into another place she might be
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.lo.1 Connie and my mother Irene.. different opinions at the same table
  t.mid.1 Had Connie at eighteen.. Irene helped, and never let me forget she was helping
  t.hi.1 Both of them can tell when I'm about to answer for them.. Irene ignores it, Connie doesn't
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Cleaning jars for Irene's neighbor.. paid less if I broke one, so mostly paid less
  t.any.2 Hospital x-ray work from eighty.. learned to ask which person before moving anything
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Canning.. could finish something and see it stay finished on a shelf
  t.any.2 Tried to make every jar label neat.. Irene said food couldn't read
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Rented house.. could see whether the jars were dry from the path
  t.any.2 One room Connie kept telling me to knock at.. would give a lot for that argument now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_KEEPSAKE
  gate.rule trust>=40 & gave:blanket & flag:french_told
  t.any.1 Gray flood blanket belonged to the church.. promised it back when we had dry beds.. Irene wanted it kept and I learned to call it ours instead
  fx.1 reveal f_blanket
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_KEEPSAKE.d
  t.any.1 Blanket's been with us since sixty-three.. a long story to unfold
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_KEEPSAKE.d2
  t.any.1 Giving another doesn't buy the story of this one
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_KEEPSAKE.d3
  t.any.1 Leave the old wool alone.. no more measuring what I owe
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Borrowed sugar from Irene and got a lecture about bringing the jar back.. usual exchange
  t.any.2 A patient complained the radio was too quiet.. wish that were my biggest unanswered request
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_LEFTBEHIND
  gate.rule trust>=70 & partnerGone & alone & flag:message_told
  t.hi.1 Marla wasn't missing when I took the car.. she was calling from the hospital steps.. drove away while she ran after me.. couldn't risk her saying Connie wasn't the only person who needed it
  fx.1 reveal f_marla
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_LEFTBEHIND.d
  t.any.1 Marla's last day isn't mine to tell neatly
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_LEFTBEHIND.d2
  t.any.1 Won't pretend I can describe what happened to her afterward
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_LEFTBEHIND.d3
  t.any.1 Don't ask me to say her name again.. not yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Irene saved jars.. Paul used them for screws and got told off for misusing good glass
  t.any.2 My mother stayed in Vine Grove when I last knew.. haven't got newer news to dress up
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  t.any.1 Qualified after working in x-ray.. kept studying when the household was asleep
  t.any.2 Connie learned to disagree with me out loud.. can't take credit every time she uses it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_REGRET
  gate.rule trust>=55 & partnerGone & alone & flag:car_told
  t.hi.1 Connie called in June.. heard her message, let the tape finish.. told Marla nobody had called so I could keep being the mother waiting for an answer
  fx.1 reveal f_message
  fx.2 set flag:message_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d
  t.any.1 June's still an argument Connie and I need to have
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d2
  t.any.1 Don't carry my version back to her as fact
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d3
  t.any.1 Enough.. leave my daughter's call out of this till I say
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  gate.rule trust>=25
  t.any.1 Liked science at school.. borrowed a French record too, learned two polite sentences and kept claiming I spoke it.. couldn't even ask for a bathroom
  fx.1 reveal f_french
  fx.2 set flag:french_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d
  t.any.1 Science classes suited me.. there's school in one short answer
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d2
  t.any.1 Not listing grades or proving what I learned
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d3
  t.any.1 School's not an examination you get to give me.. stop
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  gate.rule trust>=10 & partnerGone & alone
  t.any.1 Mostly between Vine Grove and the hospital.. drove farther searching for Connie in Marla's car, taken without asking.. called it borrowed, left it out of fuel instead of returning it
  fx.1 reveal f_car
  fx.2 set flag:car_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL.d
  t.any.1 Hospital road mostly.. not giving you the whole search route yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL.d2
  t.any.1 My travel choices aren't Connie's to account for
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL.d3
  t.any.1 Stop following my road through questions.. won't tell it yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1227.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.lo.1 Nurse.. worked in x-ray before I qualified
  t.mid.1 Small hospital.. knew the sound of the trolley with the bad wheel before I saw it
  t.hi.1 Marla taught me that louder wasn't clearer.. apparently need the lesson outside the hospital too
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_ADVICE
  t.any.1 Ask who wrote the jar label before trusting my reading of it.. Irene's pears sometimes looked like peas
  t.any.2 Let the person finish answering.. advice meant for me as much as you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Thirty-six.. apparently old enough to sound like Irene when I tell somebody to sit
  t.any.2 Born in fifty-seven.. yes, Connie's eighteen, the subtraction works
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Someone answering while I ask another person.. yes, I can hear myself saying it
  t.any.2 Pen that quits halfway through a name.. kept a spare for years and left it behind
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.lo.1 Sirens.. keep listening for one that doesn't stop here
  t.mid.1 Used to know what a siren brought through the hospital door.. don't anymore
  t.hi.1 A siren starts and I count who I'm responsible for.. still counting people who aren't here
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.lo.1 Beans.. anything I don't have to eat while standing
  t.mid.1 Irene's green beans with too much pepper.. she called that keeping me awake
  t.hi.1 Want the thing I didn't can myself.. don't need to recognize every meal as work
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Vine Grove.. our rented place was the one with jars crowding the window
  t.any.2 Near Vine Grove.. Irene would give you directions by who lived there in sixty-three
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Read a jar label twice.. once for what's in it, once because Irene's handwriting wanders
  t.any.2 Say answer that bit when I want to stop a whole story.. doesn't make me pleasant company
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.lo.1 A church door with somebody answering from inside
  t.mid.1 Connie choosing where to sit without checking my reaction first
  t.hi.1 Enough ordinary evenings to complain about canning again.. I'd like that tedious life back
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Me?.. was about to ask you the same thing and avoid answering
  t.mid.1 Still counting doorways like they're hospital rooms.. give me a minute
  t.mid.2 I know the answer I'd write down. Doesn't mean it's the answer I'd give you
  t.mid.3 Could use a conversation where I'm allowed not to know
  t.mid.4 Better with somebody who doesn't turn every pause into a symptom
  t.hi.1 Still looking for work to do.. hard to leave a hospital even after walking out
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Hospital coffee could bring a tired person round.. mostly to ask who'd made it
  t.any.2 Irene labeled an empty jar disappointment.. claimed it had preserved beautifully
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 A jar lid that catches without a fight.. there, off duty for one answer
  t.any.2 Mystery stories where I get the answer before the clever detective.. doesn't happen often
  t.any.3 Finishing a cup without hearing my name called halfway through it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Kim Webb.. Kim's enough unless I'm getting a bill
  t.any.2 Webb.. Connie's mother, though you can ask her own name
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_NERVOUS
  t.lo.1 Need the blanket where I can see it.. not under somebody else's bag
  t.mid.1 Checking the door isn't an instruction to you.. trying to remember I'm a guest
  t.hi.1 Could you say whether this is a short stop?.. answer that bit and I'll quit repacking
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 I'll take a minute outside if smoking's allowed.. no need to come supervise
  t.any.2 Quiet's fine.. don't mistake it for me waiting to question you
  t.any.3 Please. I don't need to explain the benefit of every little thing
  t.any.4 Stay if you like. That wasn't a discharge instruction
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Woke up asking for the pen.. had nothing to write down, just the habit
  t.any.2 If I start answering a call light in my sleep don't encourage me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.mid.1 Snowed in during seventy-eight.. Irene made me sit while she fed Connie from a red cup, kept saying the stove wouldn't improve under observation
  t.hi.1 Connie remembers the red cup Irene fed her from when we were snowed in during seventy-eight.. I watched the stove like it was a job.. glad she remembers Irene instead
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Dry weather for the gray flood blanket please.. hauling wet wool is a punishment
  t.any.2 Irene would say it's canning weather.. said that in nearly every sort of weather
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_WORLD_CHURCH
  t.any.1 Church roof isn't proof of safety.. still the first door I think of trying
  t.any.2 Know what the church did in sixty-three.. doesn't tell me what waits inside now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_WORLD_HOSPITAL
  t.any.1 Our place was overwhelmed when I left.. can't name a working hospital now
  t.any.2 Connie needs somebody who can examine her properly.. I can't substitute a confident guess
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 Haven't got a hospital bulletin.. was there, doesn't mean I know the whole county
  t.any.2 Rumor about northern roads came from a driver.. no second account to check it against
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1227.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Scrubs don't give you charge of me either.. we're done here
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1227.leave.grateful
  t.any.1 Didn't have to earn my chair with hospital answers.. needed that more than I admitted
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1227.leave.need_met
  t.any.1 Got what I came asking for.. blanket's packed, ready to decide our next stop
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1227.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Pen's in the pocket.. checking the blanket, then I'll stop taking up your doorway
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1227.react.compliment
  t.any.1 Thank you.. expected a question about the hospital, nearly answered that instead
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.gave_blanket
  t.any.1 Two blankets now.. Connie can choose without me arranging the answer
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.gave_book
  t.any.1 A story I don't have to complete standing up.. keep the pen out of it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.gave_food
  t.any.1 Something to eat before another cigarette.. needed the food more than I was admitting
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.gave_smokes
  t.any.1 Outside before I light one.. point me away from your open windows
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.gave_water
  t.any.1 Water before another smoke.. good order to be reminded of
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.ignored
  t.any.1 Can wait beside the blanket.. can't tell if you heard a word of it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.insult
  t.any.1 Scrubs don't oblige me to stand here taking that.. enough
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.refused
  t.any.1 Understood.. won't turn the scrubs into a reason you owe me more
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.sorry
  t.any.1 Heard you.. Irene would repeat the whole argument, I'd rather stop here
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.thanks
  t.any.1 You're welcome.. let me stop before I add hospital instructions to that
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.react.threat
  t.any.1 STOP!.. blanket's all I need, leave a path to the door!
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1227.return.arrive
  t.any.1 Kim.. still got Irene's blanket, still asking before I put it down
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1227.return.gave_food
  gate.rule gaveever:food
  t.any.1 Your meal got written on the jar label.. ran out of sensible paper, not gratitude
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1227.return.refused_door
  t.any.1 You couldn't do it last time.. don't need an apology, just today's answer
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1227.return.threatened
  t.any.1 Blanket stays rolled.. coming through only if we can leave without that happening again
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1228.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Ask me again after I've sat a while.. basin's fine if there's water
  t.any.2 A minute to wash in private please.. Mom doesn't have to answer this one either
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 Yes.. chair first, heroic refusal never
  t.any.2 That seat's free?.. I'll keep my notebook on my lap
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_HOUSE_CHORES
  t.any.1 Something I can sort here.. give me a task instead of a demonstration of how poorly I walk
  t.any.2 I can wipe the table from a chair.. Grandma could direct a whole kitchen from hers
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Can I hear the report myself?.. Mom's summaries leave out the uncertain bits
  t.any.2 Keep it quiet if you need.. just enough sound to tell it's still working
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_HOUSE_SHELF
  t.any.1 Baseball book if there's one.. numbers that don't tell me where to go
  t.any.2 A mystery would do.. liked finding a wrong answer that the next chapter actually corrected
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Where may I put the notebook?.. don't want it mistaken for spare paper
  t.any.2 Your house, your rules.. tell them to me as well as Mom please
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  t.any.1 Scorecard pencil and notebook.. key, few papers, nothing worth a dramatic search
  t.any.2 Empty record sleeve.. protects the notebook, that's what I tell people
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_FUTURE
  gate.rule trust>=75 & partnerGone & alone & flag:steps_told
  t.hi.1 Agreed we'd go north.. still want Louisville, a room that's really mine.. let Mom find me help while I pretended I'd settled it.. need to tell her before I go, not leave another tape
  fx.1 reveal f_louisville
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_FUTURE.d
  t.any.1 Doctor first.. can't decide the whole map from this chair
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_FUTURE.d2
  t.any.1 Don't negotiate my destination with Mom
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_FUTURE.d3
  t.any.1 No.. going somewhere together isn't hers or yours to decide for me
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Can keep a list if you need one.. sitting doesn't mean I'm waiting to be moved
  t.any.2 Read the labels and count what you want counted.. don't send me walking to prove a point
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.lo.1 Yes.. can still answer that without a doctor's opinion
  t.mid.1 Enough that a plate looks more useful than a map right now
  t.hi.1 I'll say when it's enough.. Mom's used to finishing that sentence for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_HURT
  gate.rule trust>=58 & partnerGone & alone & flag:graves_told
  t.hi.1 Fell on bus steps.. before Mom found me.. told her it was all the walking because a fall would start the whole story of why I shouldn't have left.. doctor needs the fall part
  fx.1 reveal f_steps
  fx.2 set flag:steps_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_HURT.d
  t.any.1 Walking hurts.. that's the answer I can give here
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_HURT.d2
  t.any.1 Mom doesn't need to hear another version from you
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_HURT.d3
  t.any.1 Not explaining it in the hallway.. asked for a doctor, not an audience
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_PARTNER
  gate.rule partner
  t.any.1 Mom's here.. has she already told you what I need before I got a turn?
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_PARTNER.a2
  gate.rule partnerGone
  t.any.1 She's trying.. want her to ask what I can do instead of telling people what I can't
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_PARTNER.a2.d
  t.any.1 She's right here.. won't make her an absent subject
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_PARTNER.a2.d2
  t.any.1 Ask Mom what she thinks.. don't use me to do it for her
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Doctor.. after that we can argue with the map
  t.any.2 Find somebody who can give a real answer about this pain.. less cheering, more finding
  t.any.3 Louisville was the idea. An idea isn't proof it's possible now
  t.any.4 The next choice ought to be mine. Doesn't mean I've made it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.any.1 Tell me what you actually know about the doctor.. I'll start there
  t.any.2 People get certainty for free when they speak loudly.. rather see the notebook
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 A doctor who isn't related to me.. Mom knows why that matters even when she argues
  t.any.2 Somewhere to sit and a clear answer about what's nearby.. no promises dressed as facts
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 I'd like my own.. Mom's wool one smells like every house we stopped at
  t.any.2 If you can spare it.. don't need someone making this decision into a family debate
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Yes.. thanks for waiting for my answer
  t.any.2 Mine, not something you're passing through Mom?.. good, I'll take it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_OFFER_MAP
  t.any.1 Show me the doctor possibilities.. guesses in pencil please
  t.any.2 I can read it here.. don't need Mom tracing my route for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 Party-line phone at Grandma's.. learned to wait till another conversation ended
  t.any.2 Red cup from the snow year.. Mom remembers saving the household, I remember the cup
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.lo.1 Trying to get clear directions.. every grown person suddenly knew less than yesterday
  t.mid.1 Kept the room key ready.. couldn't admit a key wasn't a plan
  t.hi.1 Saw Mom and nearly complained she'd come for me.. first words I could manage were completely useless
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.lo.1 Mom and Grandma Irene.. Rex is my father, not living with us
  t.mid.1 Grandma's two rings used to settle whose call it was.. wish the rest had been that clear
  t.hi.1 Mom helped more than I liked admitting.. helping isn't the same as deciding where I go
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Small errands for Grandma's neighbor.. enough for used records, not enough for rent
  t.any.2 Never had the grand first job story.. still waiting for a better answer to that question
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Baseball scores first.. record collecting when I had cash left
  t.any.2 Ellen watched the whole field.. I kept looking down to make sure my numbers agreed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Vine Grove house.. Mom's jars made the window smaller every autumn
  t.any.2 Louisville room had a crooked table.. only put one record on it so nothing rolled off
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Looking at a record I couldn't afford.. annoyed for a completely ordinary reason
  t.any.2 Ellen arguing that my pencil marks were too faint.. would let her borrow it now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_MONEY
  gate.rule trust>=28 & partnerGone & alone
  t.any.1 Sold one of Rex's records for the bus.. said it came from my collection.. he left it, doesn't mean he gave it to me, does it?
  fx.1 reveal f_record
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d
  t.any.1 Bus fare came from a record.. don't want to explain which
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d2
  t.any.1 Eighteen doesn't make every thing in the house mine.. I know that
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d3
  t.any.1 Leave the empty sleeve alone.. no more questions about the sale
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_NIGHTS
  gate.rule trust>=43 & partnerGone & alone & gave:blanket & flag:letter_told
  t.hi.1 Didn't stay with a friend after Mavis.. slept beside the graveyard two nights.. quietest place I could find and I hated every quiet minute.. that's why I called home
  fx.1 reveal f_graves
  fx.2 set flag:graves_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_NIGHTS.d
  t.any.1 Found somewhere after the room.. don't make a whole tale of it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_NIGHTS.d2
  t.any.1 The blanket's kind.. doesn't buy the address I slept at
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_NIGHTS.d3
  t.any.1 NO.. the nights are mine, stop asking for them
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Mom's a nurse.. Rex left in eighty-seven, records stayed longer than he did
  t.any.2 She was eighteen when she had me.. tells me that when she thinks I'm not considering consequences
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  t.any.1 Kept a complete season's scores without borrowing the sports pages
  t.any.2 Got to Louisville on my own.. the part afterward still needs work
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1228.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  gate.rule trust>=12 & partnerGone & alone
