  t.any.2 Would take another layer.. shivering doesn't improve my jokes
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Could carry things.. feet do work even while I complain
  t.any.2 Washing or sorting.. happy enough working with both boots on the floor
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.any.1 Not much.. ate before the walking got dull
  t.any.2 Could manage a bite.. Mavis always said my eyes ordered more than my stomach
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_HURT
