  fx.1 reveal f_ears
  fx.2 set flag:ears_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_HURT.d
  t.any.1 Feet rubbed sore.. no fresh cut for dressing
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_HURT.d2
  t.any.1 Boots are the trouble I'm ready to discuss
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Rest first.. Brandenburg when I can work out a way
  t.any.2 Try home.. not a long plan, just the one that keeps coming back
  t.any.3 Need a next step I can manage. I've sold myself on bigger ones before
  t.any.4 Not decided. If I start sounding certain, ask me what changed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY
  t.any.1 Some water please.. last drink was before this stretch of walking
  t.any.2 Would drink.. kept talking like it wasn't drying my mouth out
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Crew truck seat.. got three hours before starting this walk
  t.any.2 Last sleep was in the crew truck.. door handle in my side, still miss the seat
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.lo.1 Still holding my papers folded
  t.mid.1 Trust you enough to run out of jokes in front of you
  t.hi.1 Enough to ask you not to make forgiving me your chore
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_WANT
  gate.rule trust>=10
  t.any.1 Want Mavis to hear me.. took her pressure canner in ninety-two, sold it to Ron Bell for forty-five dollars.. bought a motorcycle part.. want her forgiveness, haven't earned her hearing me yet
  fx.1 reveal f_canner
  fx.2 set flag:canner_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_WANT.d
  t.any.1 Need to talk to my mother.. not something you can fetch from a shelf
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_WANT.d2
  t.any.1 Forgiveness from somebody who knows me.. don't know how to ask cleanly
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1250.VQ_NOW_WASH
  t.any.1 Yes.. these cuffs could stand up without me
  t.any.2 Would like soap.. water alone isn't winning against the dirt
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_OFFER_BED
  t.any.1 Could use sleep.. boots would have to wait outside the bedding
  t.any.2 Yes please.. won't play the whistle to announce getting up
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_OFFER_BOOK
  t.any.1 Cookery if you've got it.. Mavis taught me most of what I know
  t.any.2 Could borrow something funny.. might improve my stock of jokes
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_OFFER_DRINK
  t.any.1 Water please.. can supply enough chatter of my own
  t.any.2 Would appreciate something to drink.. mouth's earned a pause
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Would take a little.. can't pretend the beans followed me here
  t.any.2 Yes.. don't need a joke as the price of it, I hope
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_PAST_BOSS
  t.any.1 Otis Vale first.. could make waiting feel like work
  t.any.2 Crew boss wanted the right tool, not a story about why I brought the wrong one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 Cousins' fence was our meeting place.. neither household wanted all of us at once
  t.any.2 Brandenburg with Dee and Brent next door.. one punishment could get both houses involved
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 With the line crew.. tools halfway put away when somebody said not to go farther
  t.any.2 Crew truck near Brandenburg.. everybody suddenly wanting the front seat to hear the radio
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Mavis and Leonard, parents.. Dee and Brent next door
  t.any.2 Parents in Brandenburg when I last knew.. Dee and Brent lived next door
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1250.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  gate.rule trust>=25 & flag:canner_told
